Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thirty-Sixth Episode\NThe Spell of Mephisto
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.74,0:02:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the roast lizard ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.94,0:02:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring the bat eye soup immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.26,0:02:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Hecate?\NAren't you eating anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.02,0:02:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- No, I'm full now.\N- Eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.70,0:02:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never become a\Ngreat witch if you eat so little!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.34,0:02:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hurry up!\N- Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.66,0:02:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we are with the dishes,\Nwith the delicacies we've cooked!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.34,0:02:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Such treats!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.50,0:02:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I had today's menu prepared...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.50,0:02:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,..taking into account the\Ndiet you have to follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.98,0:02:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- Here you go!\N- Here you go! - Here you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.18,0:02:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat, Hecate! The lizard\Nwill make you tenacious..
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.74,0:02:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,and the bat eye soup\Nwill make you cunning!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.66,0:02:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, eat, Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.30,0:02:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The fire has gone out!\NWhat happened? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.62,0:03:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.58,0:03:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Mother!\NMother is back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.90,0:03:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mother is back, you say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.82,0:03:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn,\Nthe peace and quiet is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.54,0:03:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nice to return\Nafter a long absence.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.10,0:03:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope Hecate has become\Na great witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.90,0:03:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.02,0:03:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here, my dears!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.34,0:03:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.62,0:03:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- Dearest!\N- Hecate, how are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.70,0:03:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so worried\Nthinking about you,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.78,0:03:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,that I couldn't\Nthink of anything else!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.94,0:03:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even during the conference!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.06,0:03:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That damned witches'\Nconference never ended!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.86,0:04:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It lasted\Na whole long year!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.06,0:04:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you made progress\Nin your witchcraft lessons?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.46,0:04:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you agreed to receive the heart\Nof Princess Sapphire,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.30,0:04:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,which your father\Ntold me about in the letter?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.58,0:04:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Her girl's heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.34,0:04:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You will be a perfect witch\Nwith the heart of a Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.18,0:04:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Now show me\Nwhat you have learned!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.98,0:04:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- Come on! Go ahead!\N- Dear... Dear...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.34,0:04:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you know... I don't know if...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.06,0:04:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you muttering?\NSpeak more clearly!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.38,0:04:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate hasn't yet...\Nhasn't learned yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.66,0:04:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Not yet?! It's not possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.26,0:04:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, say: have you not yet\Nbecome a witch? Is it true?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.74,0:04:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And I who had placed\Nso many hopes in you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.82,0:04:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- Forgive me, mother...\N- Forgive you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.14,0:04:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Darling, I still haven't\Nmanaged to get Sapphire's heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.94,0:04:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd take a hammer to that\Neggplant head of yours...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.62,0:04:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,until it becomes a real pumpkin!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.14,0:04:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to know what the\Nhell you've been doing all year!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.18,0:04:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I spread the word\Nto the four winds...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.10,0:04:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,...saying that I have a daughter\Nwho is a real witch and you...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.46,0:05:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,How does this make\Nme look now?! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.10,0:05:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine then!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.22,0:05:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of it myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.34,0:05:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll do it my way, not like that\Nincompetent father of yours did.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.82,0:05:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Very soon I will make of you\Na true witch!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.74,0:05:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That girl named Sapphire,\Nor whatever else she is called,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.62,0:05:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- does she still live in the castle?\N- Yes, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.86,0:05:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- Let me help you, dear!\N- No! You stay and take care of the house!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.54,0:05:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What a beautiful day!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.38,0:05:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,A "forget-me-not"!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.94,0:05:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what the language\Nof "forget-me-nots" is..!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.14,0:05:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see..\NIs it a secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.02,0:05:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true, it's a secret!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.94,0:06:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That day,\NPrince Franz told me:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.78,0:06:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,"I like you, beautiful girl,\Nand I like how you dance very much!"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.70,0:06:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Secret! Secret!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.06,0:06:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Teddy bear, do you know the language\Nof "forget-me-nots"?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.70,0:06:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a pleasant secret\Nunknown to everyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.26,0:06:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,but I think that to you\NI will end up telling it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.86,0:06:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.02,0:06:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you to penetrate into the\Nmost secret part of the castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.30,0:06:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Smell that fragrance!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.18,0:06:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone who smells the scent\Nof my flowers becomes a doll,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.26,0:06:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,a charming doll\Nand obedient to its master!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.18,0:06:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up, doll!\NGo to Mephisto's cave! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.18,0:06:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to Mephisto's cave!\NAnd go there alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.82,0:07:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be easy for me to take you there
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.18,0:07:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,but I, Lady Hell,\Nadmired by all the witches,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.38,0:07:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,won't do it.\NGo on your own!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.90,0:07:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my way\Nof doing things.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.82,0:07:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Hecate,\Nfor your father's sake...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.74,0:07:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't keep repeating\Nthat you don't want to become a witch,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.94,0:07:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,otherwise your mother\Nwill fly into a rage!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.22,0:07:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Won’t you tell me why you don't\Nstudy witchcraft like the other witches?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.62,0:07:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on! Come on! Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.66,0:07:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,No! No! I don't want to become\Na witch!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.78,0:07:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon they will bring\NSapphire here and then I...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.74,0:07:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No! No! I must find\Na way to stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.14,0:07:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.14,0:07:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I have an idea to help her!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.62,0:09:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go to Mephisto's mountain,\NOpal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.14,0:09:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.50,0:09:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Mephisto's mountain,\NMephisto's mountain...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.58,0:09:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.54,0:09:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But I must go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.54,0:09:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s the matter, Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.58,0:09:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom made you smell the drug\Nthat turns people into dolls!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.54,0:09:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor Sapphire...!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.42,0:09:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if Mom\Nput the drug here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.18,0:09:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it an important flower?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.82,0:09:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- Franz...\N- Franz?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.70,0:09:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,He is the Prince of Goldland.\NHis name is Franz.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.58,0:09:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,My Franz\Nis the most beautiful Prince there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.42,0:09:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems to me that you like him a lot, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.82,0:09:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll take you to his palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.62,0:09:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me, horse!\NLet's go to Goldland!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.98,0:09:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I am certain that Prince Franz\Nwill help her!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.50,0:10:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire is not here!\NAnd neither is Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.78,0:10:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,May I know\Nwhat the hell you have done?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.42,0:10:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be angry, dear!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.58,0:10:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,We can easily find out\Nwhere Sapphire is with the magic ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.26,0:10:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Magic ball, tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.02,0:10:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Sapphire! But she is not headed here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.34,0:10:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, heavens! Perhaps my spell\Nhas broken!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.50,0:10:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's impossible!\NGet ready to go out, quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.38,0:10:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Go out?! But where do you want to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.66,0:10:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,To Goldland, blockhead!\NWhat good is that ball to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.34,0:10:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,if you don't even know how to see\Nwhere everyone is headed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.42,0:11:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look at that strange cat!\NIt looks like he has it in for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.10,0:11:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,He's dancing really well..
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.06,0:11:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I think he escaped from a circus
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.42,0:11:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Sleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.90,0:11:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Sleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.34,0:11:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we are, Sapphire!\NThis is the Prince's chamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.58,0:11:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a moment!\NHe will see us soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.58,0:12:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, come in!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.46,0:12:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is it? What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.66,0:12:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.70,0:12:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I am happy to see you, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.10,0:12:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,How kind this Prince is!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.98,0:12:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you? Why aren't you speaking?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.50,0:12:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What is wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.58,0:12:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, you are acting strange!\NDo you feel unwell?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.54,0:12:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He has a pleasant appearance\Nthat inspires confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.22,0:12:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Frank, a stranger\Nhas forced his way into the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.34,0:12:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,A stranger?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.46,0:12:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, perhaps you
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.58,0:12:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I understand..
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.42,0:12:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no stranger\Nin here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.02,0:12:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the door\Nand let me make sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.82,0:12:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone forced their way\Ninto the castle?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.18,0:12:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.34,0:12:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll inspect the room\Nmyself! Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.30,0:12:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.14,0:13:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz! It's me: your uncle\NChanel! Open the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.42,0:13:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, uncle, just a moment!\NCome here, I have an idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.66,0:13:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, come in, Uncle Chanel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.30,0:13:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,If you find anyone, you\Ncan arrest them if you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.14,0:13:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz, who is this lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.46,0:13:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady? But look at her\Nclosely, Uncle Chanel!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.06,0:13:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a doll that a dear\Nfriend of mine gave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.42,0:13:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I had to put it on the\Nsofa because it's too big...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.78,0:13:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,...to be able to fit it in a drawer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.18,0:13:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,She really looks like a girl
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.22,0:13:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,A girl with beautiful long hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.46,0:13:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, she looks like the one from the dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.82,0:14:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz? Franz! Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.38,0:14:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You are contemplating that doll\Nas if you wanted to marry her!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.42,0:14:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- Marry her?!\N- Now listen to me carefully, Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.54,0:14:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think of this lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.66,0:14:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe she isn't very beautiful, it's true,\Nbut she is very rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.46,0:14:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- I don't want her!\N- Please, be reasonable!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.66,0:14:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,At least get engaged to her!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.70,0:14:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,She will bring us a dowry\Nof a billion Yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.06,0:14:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,With that sum, Goldland\Nwill be able to do great things!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.82,0:14:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I said no!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.58,0:14:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like marrying\Nfor interest, Uncle!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.90,0:14:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- I will choose the one who will be\Nmy wife. - You selfish fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.06,0:14:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Do what I tell you, or else\Nmarry this damned doll!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.90,0:14:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I would! And right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.22,0:14:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make fun of your uncle!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.22,0:15:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This time I will succeed\Nin making you marry her!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.06,0:15:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't say yes to her by Christmas,\NI will kick you out of the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.62,0:15:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I will never obey him, Sapphire
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.90,0:15:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you escape this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.38,0:15:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I would even be capable of giving my life for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.74,0:15:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, what happened to you? It's as if you were truly a doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.62,0:15:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you listen to the conversation?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.86,0:15:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's break through the roof and take her away!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.94,0:16:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Break through the roof?! How foolish you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.50,0:16:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Any poor devil would do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.06,0:16:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.18,0:16:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not surprised at all that you haven't been able, in so many years,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.94,0:16:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,to make Hecate a real witch!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.26,0:16:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But I am not like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.34,0:16:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- How do I look?\N- Wonderful, dear!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.70,0:16:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You are beautiful! But may\NI ask what you intend to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.14,0:16:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait and you will see how\NI will manage to succeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.42,0:16:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I am very happy to meet\Nyou. Who are you, Princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.02,0:16:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Princess De Streghis\Nand I come from Hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.02,0:16:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And I am her faithful servant:\NStotten!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.14,0:16:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And what have you come to do\Nin Goldland?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.42,0:16:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.62,0:16:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell him, Stotten!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.86,0:16:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess fell in love at\Nfirst sight with Prince Franz,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.50,0:17:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,during the last military parade.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.34,0:17:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.06,0:17:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We would be delighted if you would accept\Nour introductory gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.78,0:17:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Please forgive us\Nif it is perhaps a bit too small.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.58,0:17:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not be surprised!\NWe use diamonds...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.06,0:17:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,...instead of gravel,\Nin our country!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.38,0:17:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Diamonds instead of gravel?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.54,0:17:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor fool!\NThey are just pebbles!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.06,0:17:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore we will give you\Nas many as you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.70,0:17:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If Princess De Streghis and\NPrince Franz become engaged,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.74,0:17:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,we will also give you a thousand tons\Nof ancient coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.42,0:17:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,A thousand tons?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.30,0:17:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,A thousand tons...\NA thousand tons of ancient coins!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.50,0:17:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,King Chanel, what do you say to this\Nmarriage proposal of ours?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.58,0:17:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,A thousand tons of ancient coins!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.02,0:17:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Chanel, then, do you agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.18,0:18:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I agree!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.22,0:18:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It will be the most beautiful\Nengagement in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.26,0:18:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Franz will\Nalso agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.50,0:18:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- Stotten!\N- Congratulations, Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.70,0:18:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get down to business! You must offer her\Na token of engagement.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.02,0:18:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Certainly, with pleasure!\NI'll order the ring right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.26,0:18:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I would like something\Ndifferent from a ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.38,0:18:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything you wish!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.26,0:18:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard that Prince\NFranz has a beautiful doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.06,0:18:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What? You would like his doll?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.58,0:18:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it strange, perhaps,\Nto ask for a doll?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.10,0:18:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Absolutely! There is\Nnothing strange about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.66,0:18:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll bring it to you right away! Wait for\Nme here a second! I'm going to get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.90,0:18:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems your plan\Nworked, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.42,0:18:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Open up! Open up! Franz,\Nopen the door right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.66,0:18:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz, give me the doll!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.86,0:18:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't give it to you for any reason!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.90,0:19:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It isn't very high.\NCurtains, twist yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.74,0:19:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Form a rope!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.22,0:19:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you pulling me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.42,0:19:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, break down the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.06,0:19:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz! Franz, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.62,0:19:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The window!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.30,0:19:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He's in the courtyard!\NInspect the courtyard!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.50,0:19:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, Sapphire! Hurry!\NHurry! We will hide there!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.34,0:19:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor me, this is a chapel!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.06,0:19:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't go in there,\Nbecause I am the daughter of Mephisto.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.54,0:20:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, do not fear!\NI will never leave you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.18,0:20:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I will fight against anyone\Nwho wants to hurt you,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.90,0:20:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- even if it were my uncle!\N- Did you find him?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.38,0:20:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- No!\N- Look again!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.42,0:20:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.94,0:20:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess De Streghis,\NI will have the doll before evening!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.78,0:20:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,She's gone! The jewels..!\NWhat the hell happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.90,0:20:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It didn't go well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.82,0:20:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, you idiot! I left\Nbecause I have another plan in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.50,0:20:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This drug turns\Nall creatures into stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.74,0:20:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.22,0:20:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, it really works!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.46,0:20:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And all those\Nwho drink this water..
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.94,0:21:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,.will be turned into stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.26,0:21:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand: Princess\NDe Streghis disappears,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.06,0:21:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,the jewels become stones..
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.54,0:21:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you not found Franz yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.78,0:21:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for?!\NGo and find him immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.82,0:21:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Stone! Stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.58,0:21:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,My soldiers have\Nall turned into stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.74,0:21:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be the work of Mephisto!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.74,0:22:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Mephisto! Mephisto!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.18,0:22:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there no one here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.18,0:22:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there no one left\Nin this castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.90,0:22:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,They've all\Nturned to stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.78,0:22:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, look! There's King Chanel!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.66,0:22:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Mephisto! Mephisto is\Ndefinitely in this castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.18,0:22:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, something is\Nwrong. I'm going to check.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.50,0:22:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Frank, no!\NYou mustn't go out!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.90,0:22:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, he's already gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.70,0:22:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.10,0:22:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's my uncle!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.26,0:22:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He isn't moving at all!\NLet's go have a look...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.58,0:23:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But he's turned to stone! This\Nis certainly the work of Mephisto!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.86,0:23:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- Mephisto!\N- Boy, bring Sapphire here!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.14,0:23:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- I won't do it!\N- Bring Sapphire here,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.34,0:23:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise I will hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.34,0:23:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I will defend her at the cost of my life!\NOn your guard!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.86,0:23:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hail Mephisto!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.82,0:23:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,To me, wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.06,0:23:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And now bring out Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.38,0:23:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Come and get her, if you are capable!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.58,0:23:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- Close that door!\N- I'll take care of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.86,0:23:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Stone lion,\Nflood the Chapel!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.02,0:23:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The water!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.14,0:24:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- The water!\N- Sapphire, you've regained consciousness!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.18,0:24:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes, Franz.\N- Oh, Sapphire...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.94,0:24:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz! Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.70,0:24:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- Franz!\N- Sapphire! Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.34,0:24:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire! Franz! Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.34,0:24:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The water will soon make\Nthem come out of the Chapel.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.18,0:24:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sapphire!\N- Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.54,0:24:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.34,0:24:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- Franz! Franz!\N- Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.42,0:24:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- Franz!\N- Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.18,0:24:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire! Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.74,0:24:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, I will save you!\NI will save you at any cost!
